# Known-harmless messages for ps2xRecomp/tools/runreport.py (one regex per line, say why).
# The game first looks for loose map files under \BG\ (a development layout); the retail disc has
# them only inside X3/*.MFA archives, which it then reads. Fails on a real PS2 too.
sceCdSearchFile failed.*\\BG\\
